 "nl": [
  "research must never reach vpn-users, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Any zone may connect to guest-wifi over HTTP (TCP 80) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Hosts in guest-wifi may reach admin over DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Hosts in mail may reach iot-sensors over SMTP (TCP 25) and IMAP (TCP 143) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Permit any TCP port from admin to mail but deny SMB (TCP 445), Telnet (TCP 23).",
  "research must never reach mail, regardless of any other rule.",
  "No packet from research may enter edge-cache, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Allow iot-sensors to connect to engineering using RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to dev-lab using RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Deny all traffic from printers to edge-cache (this overrides any public service).",
  "Permit any TCP port from guest-wifi to edge-cache but deny Telnet (TCP 23), RDP (TCP 3389), FTP (TCP 21).",
  "Allow research to connect to vpn-users using SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Apart from edge-cache on DNS over UDP 53, all traffic originating in iot-sensors must be dropped.",
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to dev-lab using SMTP (TCP 25) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Hosts in engineering may reach edge-cache over SMTP (TCP 25) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Any zone may connect to admin over DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443)."
 ],
